                <p>All refund requests must be submitted in writing to Impulse through the Discord server, via email, or through any other written communication channel made available by Impulse. Refunds, if approved by Impulse in its sole discretion, will be processed within five (5) to ten (10) business days of approval and will be returned using the original payment method, unless otherwise expressly agreed in writing by Impulse.</p>
