                <p>While Impulse technicians take reasonable care to preserve your data, including creating System Restore Points or rollback snapshots where technically feasible, system modifications, overclocking, software changes, and other optimization activities carry inherent risks of data loss or corruption that cannot be entirely eliminated. Even routine, seemingly safe modifications can, in rare circumstances, cause data loss or corruption due to unexpected interactions with your specific system configuration.</p>
