                <p>You acknowledge that data loss or corruption can result from a wide variety of causes, including but not limited to: software bugs or errors; driver conflicts; system crashes during write operations; power failures or interruptions; hardware failures; firmware corruption; user error; malware or viruses; and force majeure events. Impulse shall not be liable for data loss or corruption arising from any cause whatsoever.</p>
